+ "note": "Going loud as a prepared choice (Sky; Motive's plan L4c): the Enforcer brings the car round to the service drive first; Watch and Listen, Inez turned, the patrol rerouted, the camera looped, the rival car tipped away, the guard called off. He goes in the quiet way, and with his ring nearly closed the three, set in the yard, open on what comes. Vale into the car on the drive; Go when it is free.",
